    {
      "name": "Labyrinth",
      "type": "feature",
      "system": {
        "featureForm": "passive",
        "description": "<p>The party must complete a Progress Countdown (4) to find their way through the mines. Each time a PC rolls with Hope while finding their way through, they discover one of the curiosities below.</p><ul><li><p>An unmined vein of precious metals or gemstones</p></li><li><p>Various mining tools, including a broken (but mendable) mine cart made of adamantine</p></li><li><p>Psychic echoes of the miners' tragic end</p></li><li><p>The desiccated corpses of miners who lost their way in the tunnels</p></li><li><p>Tattered remnants of darkweave spider silk</p></li></ul><section id=\"secret-xz0zpURL7LpP6Y6n\" class=\"secret\"><p>What did miners previously extract here? Who in the party knows how to navigate below ground? What are the PCs most afraid might happen to them down here?</p></section>",
        "attribution": {},
        "gmNotes": "",
        "resource": null,
