        "description": "<p><strong>Spend a Fear</strong> to summon a Darkweave Queen inside her gossamer-strewn lair. She drops from the ceiling within Close range of a PC and immediately takes the spotlight.</p><section id=\"secret-i9sSpmMkF7CLcuS9\" class=\"secret\"><p>How does the Darkweave Queen use her lair to her advantage? What remnants of her past meals can the party find here?</p></section>",
