    {
      "name": "Impending Collapse",
      "type": "feature",
      "system": {
        "featureForm": "reaction",
        "description": "<p>Countdown (2). The first time the PCs roll with Fear, describe how the ground subtly vibrates as rocks shift overhead and activate the countdown. It ticks down when a PC rolls with Fear. When it triggers, each PC must succeed on an Agility Reaction Roll or take <strong>1d8+3</strong> physical damage and become temporarily <em>Restrained</em> by the rubble.</p><section id=\"secret-HE1rGi9t3pctLs3I\" class=\"secret\"><p>What other signs of instability does the mine offer the party? What new dangers does the tunnel system's new configuration expose the party to?</p></section>",
        "attribution": {},
        "gmNotes": "",
        "resource": null,
